WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Follow a monitored deal. Open a fictional business in Portfolio to review its monitoring context.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Establish the deal context. Overview links the borrower, deal terms and original underwriting.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Review Monitoring runs. Inspect recorded evaluations. A partial result needs further investigation.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Check Integrations. Connected does not mean complete or current. Compare source timestamps.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Review Notifications & flags. Find the detected changes and check their severity and status.

6
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Inspect the flag. Read available details. Missing values do not mean there is no risk.

7
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Use Raw data for the details. Inspect the metric, threshold, rule and supporting references.

8
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Follow Related records. Open the associated alert.created event to investigate notification delivery.

9
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Check Delivery attempts. This example has no attempts. A generated event does not prove delivery.
